# Check-in

- Official question ids: `belly-comfort`, `energy`, `play-pace` (scale **0–2**). Source: `src/content/check-in-questions.ts`.
- Always offer "I don't feel like it today" / `notToday`.
- Rewards never depend on answers. No symptom meters, no sad companion, no medical claims.
- Pixel / game HUD OK if generic (no Mario IP); styles in `*.style.ts` with theme tokens only.
- No raw HTML in `.tsx`. Tests next to the component.
